# EXAMPLE: this file is not read. Copy it to "authorized_keys" in the same folder
# (netcast/mainline/ on the stick; no ".example" or ".txt" at the end) and edit the copy.
#
# SSH keys for Debian on the TV. Put your PUBLIC key below, one per line: the contents of
# ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub on your computer ("ssh-keygen -t ed25519" makes one). Never put a
# private key here.
# These keys log in as "root":   ssh root@<address of the TV>
# The file is read at every boot. Lines starting with "#" are ignored.
#
# The line below is a dummy and not a working key. Replace it and remove the "#":
#ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIDUMMYKEYREPLACETHISWITHYOUROWNPUBLICKEY000 you@your-computer
